</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/aa9f6a88-8e41-11f1-83ae-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-02T011055Z-1140300478-RC2DGDAQSI8M-RTRMADP-3-JAPAN-YEN.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/aa9f6a88-8e41-11f1-83ae-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-02T011055Z-1140300478-RC2DGDAQSI8M-RTRMADP-3-JAPAN-YEN.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">af473e26-8e41-11f1-9e36-69705b654298</guid><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 07:14:36 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/aa9f6a88-8e41-11f1-83ae-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-02T011055Z-1140300478-RC2DGDAQSI8M-RTRMADP-3-JAPAN-YEN.jpg">REUTERS - Dado Ruvic</source><dc:creator>东京特约记者 楚良一</dc:creator></item><item><category>亚洲</category><title>中国在日中中间线附近建立新设施 日本强烈抗议</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%B2/20260801-%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%9C%A8%E6%97%A5%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%AD%E9%97%B4%E7%BA%BF%E9%99%84%E8%BF%91%E5%BB%BA%E7%AB%8B%E6%96%B0%E8%AE%BE%E6%96%BD-%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E5%BC%BA%E7%83%88%E6%8A%97%E8%AE%AE</link><description>
